  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in Senate",
    "asOf": "2025-07-17",
    "date": "2026-10-20T19:12:32Z",
    "text": "Cooper Davis and Devin Norring Act\n\nThis bill requires\u00a0electronic communication service providers and remote computing service providers to report knowledge of offenses involving the creation, manufacture, distribution, or dispensing of\u00a0counterfeit controlled substances (including counterfeit prescription drugs), fentanyl, methamphetamine, or prescription pain medications or stimulants to the Drug Enforcement Administration. Providers are subject to criminal and civil penalties for failing to comply with these requirements."
  },
